# Tools

| Directory | Description |
|---|---|
| [`tlb-info/`](tlb-info/) | Reads TLB topology (levels, sets, ways, page sizes) from CPUID leaf 0x18 |
| [`tlb-test/`](tlb-test/) | Tools for measuring TLB timing and transient window behavior |

## tlb-info

Queries **CPUID leaf 0x18** to report detailed TLB topology: levels, cache types (data/instruction/unified), number of entries, sets, ways, and supported page sizes. See [`tlb-info/README.md`](tlb-info/README.md).

## tlb-test

Two tools for characterizing TLB timing and transient execution windows. Both require the kernel module to be loaded. See [`tlb-test/README.md`](tlb-test/README.md).

| Tool | Description |
|---|---|
| `threshold` | Measures L1/L2 TLB hit and PTW latencies; recommends a hit/miss threshold |
| `test_window` | Sweeps transient window sizes and counts Page Table Walk completions per window |